<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA APRIL NET AT PLN 1.25 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA APRIL NET AT PLN 1.25 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.25 vs   1.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.81 vs   1.84</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.98 vs   2.16</p>
<p> Sales		   17.06 vs  16.94</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.11 vs   4.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.56 vs   6.77</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.93 vs   7.64</p>
<p> Sales		   69.79 vs  63.08</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
